fast-mafft v10: a faster drop-in replacement for MAFFT v7.526 (default FFT-NS-2) with byte-identical output.

Base:    MAFFT v7.526, https://gitlab.com/sysimm/mafft, tag v7.526,
         commit ee9799916df6a5d5103d46d54933f8eb6d28e244 ("Version number -> 7.526").
Files:   21 under core/: 14 changed (Falign.c Galign11.c MSalignmm.c Makefile Salignmm.c disttbfast.c
         f2cl.c fft.c fftFunctions.c functions.h io.c mafft.tmpl mltaln9.c tddis.c) and 7 new
         (adpvec_body.h crtolf.c dphelp.h gdpvec_body.h lazygap.h mrowblk_body.h progtiming.h).
Apply:   from the top directory of a clean v7.526 tree:
             patch -p1 < fast-mafft-v10.patch       (or: git apply fast-mafft-v10.patch)
         The result is identical, file for file, to fast-mafft-src/.
Build:   see BUILD.md (make clean first; pass the same PREFIX to "make" and "make install").
Details: CHANGES.md (what changed, why the output stays byte-identical), VERIFICATION.md.

